{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 12 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">去噪与图像恢复：残差、盲点与长程建模的假设边界</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Denoising &amp; Restoration</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_113_noise2void-title\">Noise2Void</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">Noise2Void 通过输入操纵构造 blind spot，只从单张 noisy 图像回归其被隐藏中心，而非需要成对噪声或 clean target。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Implements practical single-image blind-spot denoising by randomly masking center pixels via neighborhood replacement so a standard U-Net predicts held-out pixels.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">一张噪声图像；训练时随机选取中心像素并用邻域值替换</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Single noisy image (with random center pixels replaced by neighboring values during training)</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">每个像素的条件期望估计形成的去噪图像</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Denoised image estimate x̂ from a single forward pass</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figures 2 and 3 · PDF pp.4 and 5</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始方法示意图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content_CVPR_2019/html/Krull_Noise2Void_-_Learning_Denoising_From_Single_Noisy_Images_CVPR_2019_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_113_noise2void')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_113_noise2void')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"Noise2Void original paper architecture figure, Figures 2 and 3\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/3fa94f715753558b0311.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figures 2 and 3 · PDF pp.4 and 5</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 7 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_113_noise2void', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_113_noise2void\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_113_noise2void')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_113_noise2void', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_113_noise2void\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 07 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">单张 noisy image</span><span class=\"lang-en\">noisy image</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">不需要 clean target 或重复采集</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests single noisy image (with random center pixels replaced by neighboring values during training) and prepares initial tensor representations (noisy image).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"不需要 clean target 或重复采集\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests single noisy image (with random center pixels replaced by neighboring values during training) and prepares initial tensor representations (noisy image).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"单张 noisy image\" data-node-name-en=\"noisy image\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_113_noise2void', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">单张 noisy image</span><span class=\"lang-en\">noisy image</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">不需要 clean target 或重复采集</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests single noisy image (with random center pixels replaced by neighboring values during training) and prepares initial tensor representations (noisy image).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"选择少量中心像素作为本轮监督位置\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes pixel sampling to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"随机像素采样\" data-node-name-en=\"pixel sampling\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_113_noise2void', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">随机像素采样</span><span class=\"lang-en\">pixel sampling</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">选择少量中心像素作为本轮监督位置</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes pixel sampling to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"把中心值替换为邻域随机值，使网络不能复制目标像素\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Blind-spot manipulation within the core single image blind spot denoising computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Blind-spot manipulation\" data-node-name-en=\"Blind-spot manipulation\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_113_noise2void', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Blind-spot manipulation</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">把中心值替换为邻域随机值，使网络不能复制目标像素</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Blind-spot manipulation within the core single image blind spot denoising computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"仅从周围空间上下文预测被替换中心\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs CNN/U-Net denoiser within the core single image blind spot denoising computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"CNN/U-Net denoiser\" data-node-name-en=\"CNN/U-Net denoiser\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_113_noise2void', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>CNN/U-Net denoiser</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">仅从周围空间上下文预测被替换中心</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs CNN/U-Net denoiser within the core single image blind spot denoising computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"输出与原 noisy 中心值比较，未采样像素不计损失\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs sampling loss within the core single image blind spot denoising computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"采样位置回归损失\" data-node-name-en=\"sampling loss\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_113_noise2void', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">采样位置回归损失</span><span class=\"lang-en\">sampling loss</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">输出与原 noisy 中心值比较，未采样像素不计损失</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs sampling loss within the core single image blind spot denoising computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"推理时不再替换像素，网络一次输出所有位置\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Stage 06 to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"全图普通前向\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 06\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_113_noise2void', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">全图普通前向</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 06</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">推理时不再替换像素，网络一次输出所有位置</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Stage 06 to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"估计由邻域条件决定的 clean signal\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces denoised image estimate x̂ from a single forward pass via Denoised Image.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"去噪图像\" data-node-name-en=\"Denoised Image\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_113_noise2void', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">去噪图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Denoised Image</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">估计由邻域条件决定的 clean signal</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces denoised image estimate x̂ from a single forward pass via Denoised Image.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"Noise2Void Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 盲点条件独立假设下的单图自监督去噪</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Blind-Spot Center-Pixel Replacement Training Under Pixel-Wise Conditional Independence</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"Noise2Void：核心公式 · 盲点条件独立假设下的单图自监督去噪\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"113\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"22.830181pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.742477 -69.000129 225.64015 22.830181\" width=\"225.64015pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M6.017435-1.882939H5.469489C4.921544-.627646 4.333748-.627646 3.088418-.627646C2.938979-.627646 2.181818-.577833 2.181818-.797011L2.191781-3.118306L3.516812-3.108344C4.303861-3.098381 4.333748-2.929016 4.443337-2.191781H4.931507V-4.712329H4.443337C4.333748-3.985056 4.293898-3.795766 3.516812-3.795766H2.191781V-5.788294C2.191781-5.947696 2.191781-5.967621 2.361146-5.967621H3.73599C4.60274-5.967621 4.83188-5.858032 4.98132-4.961395H5.489415L5.449564-6.615193H.089664V-6.156912C.71731-6.117061 .926526-6.127024 .926526-5.429639V-1.165629C.926526-.478207 .71731-.478207 .089664-.438356V.029888H5.50934L6.017435-1.882939ZM5.618929-1.534247L5.290162-.268991H.826899C1.175592-.428394 1.215442-.816936 1.215442-1.165629V-5.429639C1.215442-5.778331 1.185554-6.166874 .816936-6.326276H5.17061L5.190535-5.389788C4.971357-6.236613 4.41345-6.256538 3.646326-6.256538H2.361146C2.012453-6.256538 1.902864-6.117061 1.902864-5.788294V-3.506849H3.516812C4.104608-3.506849 4.483188-3.576588 4.64259-4.194271V-2.709838C4.483188-3.337484 4.1046