use x=\"56.865041\" xlink:href=\"#m113_g21-50\" y=\"-64.102131\"></use><use x=\"56.865041\" xlink:href=\"#m113_g21-50\" y=\"-54.590604\"></use><use x=\"62.65993\" xlink:href=\"#m113_g17-150\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"78.616702\" xlink:href=\"#m113_g17-53\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"82.856112\" xlink:href=\"#m113_g14-162\" y=\"-62.485984\"></use><use x=\"82.176854\" xlink:href=\"#m113_g14-92\" y=\"-55.447118\"></use><use x=\"91.059752\" xlink:href=\"#m113_g11-25\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"100.16332\" xlink:href=\"#m113_g0-69\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"106.848257\" xlink:href=\"#m113_g11-187\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"110.464675\" xlink:href=\"#m113_g17-71\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"115.186966\" xlink:href=\"#m113_g14-56\" y=\"-56.877043\"></use><use x=\"121.472742\" xlink:href=\"#m113_g11-106\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"127.029611\" xlink:href=\"#m113_g17-72\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use><use x=\"132.287898\" xlink:href=\"#m113_g8-78\" y=\"-56.74079\"></use><use x=\"139.226077\" xlink:href=\"#m113_g8-185\" y=\"-56.74079\"></use><use x=\"142.011524\" xlink:href=\"#m113_g14-56\" y=\"-56.74079\"></use><use x=\"144.996971\" xlink:href=\"#m113_g8-186\" y=\"-56.74079\"></use><use x=\"148.000599\" xlink:href=\"#m113_g8-110\" y=\"-56.74079\"></use><use x=\"151.346055\" xlink:href=\"#m113_g14-56\" y=\"-56.74079\"></use><use x=\"154.465945\" xlink:href=\"#m113_g11-188\" y=\"-58.371424\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">监督去噪需要干净目标，Noise2Noise 仍需独立噪声配对</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Exact J-invariant mask-by-mask forward passes were computationally slow, while supervised denoising required unavailable clean targets.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">通过 blind-spot 预测遮挡中心像素，仅用单张噪声图像训练去噪网络</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Create a receptive-field blind spot via a simple input masking scheme (replacing target pixels with a random neighbor) so gradients flow only through surrounding context.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">利用条件独立、零均值噪声假设从同一图像构造自监督目标</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Efficient multi-pixel blind-spot training recipe applicable to any standard U-Net without paired or clean training data.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">用于显微、低剂量和无法重复采集的医学图像去噪</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Widely used in biomedical microscopy, OCT speckle reduction, and single-acquisition low-dose imaging.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">自监督去噪经典方法；结构化噪声和相关噪声会违反假设</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Classic self-supervised denoiser; structured/correlated noise violates pixel-wise independence and gets preserved as signal.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">训练时遮断中心像素自身到输出的捷径，只允许网络利用邻域。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">若噪声在给定信号下零均值且像素间条件独立，预测 noisy 中心的期望等于 clean 信号。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">稀疏采样位置计算损失，使一张图像自身即可同时提供输入和目标。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Create a receptive-field blind spot via a simple input masking scheme (replacing target pixels with a random neighbor) so gradients flow only through surrounding context.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Efficient multi-pixel blind-spot training recipe applicable to any standard U-Net without paired or clean training data.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Blind-Spot Center-Pixel Replacement Training Under Pixel-Wise Conditional Independence.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">适用于显微、低剂量和难以重复采集 clean/noisy pair 的场景。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">空间相关噪声、结构化条纹、重建伪影或邻域内不独立的 MRI 噪声会破坏核心假设。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Widely used in biomedical microscopy, OCT speckle reduction, and single-acquisition low-dose imaging.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Classic self-supervised denoiser; structured/correlated noise violates pixel-wise independence and gets preserved as signal.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content_CVPR_2019/html/Krull_Noise2Void_-_Learning_Denoising_From_Single_Noisy_Images_CVPR_2019_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Noise2Void - Learning Denoising From Single Noisy Images</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/juglab/n2v\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}